<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>雅思阅读真经 5 · Summary 填空题改写透视库</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --card-border: #334155;
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      
      --locator-color: #38bdf8;
      --locator-bg: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      --locator-border: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
      
      --para-color: #fbbf24;
      --para-bg: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15);
      --para-border: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);
      
      --ans-color: #4ade80;
      --ans-bg: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.18);
      --ans-border: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.5);

      --trap-color: #f87171;
      --trap-bg: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
      --trap-border: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
    }
    
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 30px 20px 80px;
    }
    .container { max-width: 940px; margin: 0 auto; }
    
    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    }
    h1 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #fff; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
    
    .nav-tabs {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .nav-tab {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: #162032;
    }
    .nav-tab:hover, .nav-tab.active {
      color: #fff;
      background: #2563eb;
      border-color: #3b82f6;
    }

    .legend-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .legend-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .tag-loc { color: var(--locator-color); background: var(--locator-bg); border: 1px solid var(--locator-border); }
    .tag-para { color: var(--para-color); background: var(--para-bg); border: 1px solid var(--para-border); }
    .tag-ans { color: var(--ans-color); background: var(--ans-bg); border: 1px solid var(--ans-border); }
    .tag-trap { color: var(--trap-color); background: var(--trap-bg); border: 1px solid var(--trap-border); }

    .passage-section {
      margin-top: 35px;
    }
    .passage-title-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
      border: 1px solid #3b82f6;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .passage-title-bar h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .passage-meta {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #93c5fd;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }
    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--card-border);
    }
    .q-title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
    .q-ans-pill {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--ans-color);
      background: var(--ans-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--ans-border);
      padding: 3px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    
    .locator-line {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--locator-color);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--locator-color);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    
    .block {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: #162032;
    }
    .block-header {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .header-stem { color: #f97316; }
    .header-orig { color: #38bdf8; }
    
    .en-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }
    .zh-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    
    .logic-box {
      background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .logic-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #c084fc;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .logic-list {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      padding-left: 18px;
    }
    .logic-list li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

    /* Trap Box for User Mistakes */
    .trap-box {
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid var(--trap-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .trap-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--trap-color);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .trap-content {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #fca5a5;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    
    /* Highlight Classes */
    .loc {
      color: var(--locator-color);
      background: var(--locator-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--locator-border);
      padding: 1px 5px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .para {
      color: var(--para-color);
      background: var(--para-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--para-border);
      padding: 1px 5px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .ans {
      color: var(--ans-color);
      background: var(--ans-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--ans-border);
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .wrong-ans {
      color: var(--trap-color);
      background: var(--trap-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--trap-border);
      padding: 1px 5px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: line-through;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-right: 6px;
    }
    .badge-q { background: #ea580c; color: #fff; }
    .badge-orig { background: #0284c7; color: #fff; }
    .badge-warn { background: #dc2626; color: #fff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <header>
    <h1>雅思阅读真经 5 · Summary 填空题改写透视库</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">考官题干检索 ⇄ 原文出处母本 ⇄ 同义换皮解析 ⇄ 错因深度靶向</div>
    <div class="nav-tabs">
      <a href="#passage-3" class="nav-tab active">Passage 3: Lost Giant: Mammoth（猛犸象 · P20-P24）</a>
      <a href="#passage-2" class="nav-tab">Passage 2: Alfred Nobel（诺贝尔 · P14-P17）</a>
      <a href="#passage-1" class="nav-tab">Passage 1: The Refrigerator（冰箱 · P9-P11）</a>
      <a href="#passage-4" class="nav-tab">Passage 4: Tasmanian Tigers（袋狼 · P27-P30）</a>
    </div>
    <div class="legend-bar">
      <div class="legend-tag tag-loc">🔵 蓝色：黄金定位词（秒查坐标）</div>
      <div class="legend-tag tag-para">🟠 橙色：同义替换改写（换皮特征）</div>
      <div class="legend-tag tag-ans">🟢 绿色：标准答案（原文原词）</div>
      <div class="legend-tag tag-trap">🔴 红色：错题陷阱剖析</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ================= PASSAGE 3 ================= -->
  <section id="passage-3" class="passage-section">
    <div class="passage-title-bar">
      <h2>Reading Passage 3: Lost Giant: Mammoth（失落的巨兽：猛犸象）</h2>
      <div class="passage-meta">
        <span>📍 对应位置：PDF P37-P41 / 纸质 P20-P24</span>
        <span>🎯 题型：Summary 细节填空（Q1-Q7 年代史 + Q8-Q12 生物特征）</span>
        <span>⏱️ 本次耗时：23 分钟（12 题对 9 题，正确率 75%）</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= Section 1: Q1-Q7 ================= -->
    <h3 style="color:#60a5fa; margin-bottom:16px; font-size:16px; border-left:4px solid #3b82f6; padding-left:10px;">
      Part 1: The chronology of mammoths（猛犸象年代演变史 · Q1-Q7）
    </h3>

    <!-- Q1 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 1: 猛犸象最初的起源地</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">Africa</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>about 5 million years ago</code>（数字地标）、<code>mammoths originated from</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Fossil evidences show that <span class="loc">about 5 million years ago</span> mammoths <span class="para">originated from</span> 1 <span class="ans">[Africa]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          化石证据表明，在<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">大约500万年前</span>，猛犸象<span style="color:var(--para-color);">起源于</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">非洲</span>】。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P38 第3段第1-3行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          It has long been clear that mammoths <span class="para">arose in</span> <span class="ans">Africa</span>, says Lister, because fossils of ancestral mammoths <span class="loc">dating back as far as 5 million years ago</span> have been found there.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          李斯特表示，长期以来人们就很清楚猛犸象<span style="color:var(--para-color);">起源于</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">非洲</span>，因为在那里发现了<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">追溯到500万年前</span>的祖先猛犸象化石。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>动词同义替换</strong>：原文 <code>arose in</code>（产生/起源于）改写为题干 <code>originated from</code>（起源于）；</li>
          <li><strong>时间表述改写</strong>：原文 <code>dating back as far as 5 million years ago</code> 简化为题干 <code>about 5 million years ago</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>专有名词提取</strong>：起源大洲名称 <code>Africa</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q2: 错题 -->
    <div class="card" style="border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 2: 猛犸象分支迁徙的目的地</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">Asia</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>split off</code>、<code>migrated to</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Then some mammoths <span class="loc">split off</span> and <span class="para">migrated to</span> 2 <span class="ans">[Asia]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          随后一部分猛犸象<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">分化出来</span>，并<span style="color:var(--para-color);">迁徙到了</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">亚洲</span>】。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P38 第3段后半部分)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          The studies show that the lineage leading to African elephants <span class="loc">split off</span> from the common ancestor first, around 6 million years ago. Not too long after that, the mammoths <span class="para">forked away from what would become the</span> <span class="ans">Asian</span> elephant.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          研究表明，通往非洲象的谱系在大约600万年前首先从共同祖先中<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">分化出来</span>。在那之后不久，猛犸象又与后来演变成<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">亚洲</span>象的谱系<span style="color:var(--para-color);">分道扬镳</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>动词短语改写</strong>：原文 <code>forked away from what would become the Asian elephant</code>（与未来的亚洲象分支分开）改写为题干 <code>migrated to [Asia]</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>形容词转专有名词</strong>：考官将原文的形容词 <code>Asian</code> 转换为大洲名词 <code>Asia</code>（《真经5》机经还原出题的词形变通）。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="trap-box">
        <div class="trap-title"><span class="badge badge-warn">错题剖析</span> 为什么这道题容易错？</div>
        <div class="trap-content">
          <strong>1. 介词 <code>to</code> 强制要求地点名词</strong>：题干写的是 <code>migrated to 2 [______]</code>，介词 <code>to</code> 后面必须接一个大洲或地域名词。原文对应句里只有 <code>Asian elephant</code>，很多考生因为原文没有直接出现 <code>Asia</code> 而愣住，甚至错填了 <code>Asian elephant</code>（违背了“迁徙到某地”的地理语义）。<br>
          <strong>2. 考点本质</strong>：考官考查的是由“非洲起源（Africa）”迁徙分散到“亚洲分支（Asia）”的宏观地理逻辑。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q3 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 3: 适应250万年前冰期演变出的新物种</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">steppe mammoth</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>climate change</code>、<code>around 2.5 million years ago</code>（数字地标）、<code>new species</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          In order to <span class="para">cope with the climate change that occurred</span> <span class="loc">around 2.5 million years ago</span>, mammoths <span class="para">evolved into a new species, called the</span> 3 <span class="ans">[steppe mammoth]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          为了<span style="color:var(--para-color);">应对</span><span style="color:var(--locator-color);">大约250万年前发生的</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">气候变化</span>，猛犸象<span style="color:var(--para-color);">演变出了一个名为</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">草原猛犸象（steppe mammoth）</span>】<span style="color:var(--para-color);">的新物种</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P38 第4段末至第5段初)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          ...<span class="loc">Around 2.5 million years ago</span>, an epoch of ice ages began... These dramatic changes <span class="para">led to the evolution of a new kind of mammoth, the</span> <span class="ans">steppe mammoth</span>, which <span class="para">adapted to life in a colder world</span>...
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          ……<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">大约250万年前</span>，冰河纪时期开启……这些剧烈的变化<span style="color:var(--para-color);">导致了一种新型猛犸象——</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">草原猛犸象</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">的进化，它适应了更寒冷世界的生存</span>……
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>因果同义改写</strong>：原文 <code>adapted to life in a colder world</code>（适应更冷世界）改写为题干 <code>cope with the climate change</code>（应对气候变化）；</li>
          <li><strong>词对改写</strong>：原文 <code>evolution of a new kind of</code> 改写为 <code>evolved into a new species</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>原词提取</strong>：同位语直接带出新物种名称 <code>steppe mammoth</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q4 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 4: 通过陆桥进入的大陆</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">North America</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>About 1.7 millions years ago</code>、<code>from China</code>、<code>Northern Hemisphere</code>、<code>land bridge</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          <span class="loc">About 1.7 millions years ago</span>, these animals gradually <span class="loc">spread out from China across the Northern Hemisphere</span>, and <span class="para">travelled via land bridge into</span> 4 <span class="ans">[North America]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          <span style="color:var(--locator-color);">大约170万年前</span>，这些动物逐渐<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">从中国扩散至整个北半球</span>，并通过<span style="color:var(--para-color);">陆桥进入了</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">北美洲</span>】。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P38 第6段第1-5行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Fossils recently unearthed in <span class="loc">China</span> show that the steppe mammoth evolved there <span class="loc">about 1.7 million years ago</span> and gradually <span class="loc">spread out across the Northern Hemisphere</span>... It was around this time that some mammoths <span class="para">crossed a land bridge joining Siberia to</span> <span class="ans">North America</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          最近在中国出土的化石表明，草原猛犸象<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">大约在170万年前</span>在那里进化，并逐渐<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">扩散至北半球各地</span>……大约就在这个时候，一些猛犸象<span style="color:var(--para-color);">穿过连接西伯利亚与</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">北美洲</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">的陆桥</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>动词同义改写</strong>：原文 <code>crossed a land bridge joining Siberia to...</code> 改写为题干 <code>travelled via land bridge into...</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>专有名词原词提取</strong>：大洲专有名词 <code>North America</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q5 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 5: 继续向南扩散到达的最远地域</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">Central America</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>went further south to</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Some of them <span class="para">went further south to</span> 5 <span class="ans">[Central America]</span>...
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          它们中的一些<span style="color:var(--para-color);">进一步向南到达了</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">中美洲</span>】……
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P38 第6段第7-8行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          ...There, mammoths evolved into distinctive North American forms and some <span class="para">eventually spread as far south as</span> <span class="ans">Central America</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          ……在那里，猛犸象演化成了独特的北美物种形态，有些<span style="color:var(--para-color);">最终向南扩散到了远至</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">中美洲</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">的地方</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>方位同义改写</strong>：原文 <code>spread as far south as</code> 改写为题干 <code>went further south to</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>地理专有名词提取</strong>：原词照抄 <code>Central America</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q6: 错题 -->
    <div class="card" style="border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 6: 最终演变出的最著名的种类</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">woolly mammoth</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>evolved to</code>、<code>well-known kind</code>、<code>named the</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          ...where they <span class="para">evolved to the well-known kind, named the</span> 6 <span class="ans">[woolly mammoth]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          ……在那里它们<span style="color:var(--para-color);">演变出了众所周知的种类，名为</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">长毛猛犸象（woolly mammoth）</span>】。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P38 第6段末尾)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Meanwhile, some steppe mammoths were becoming ever more specialised for cold climates and open grassland, <span class="para">giving rise to the</span> <span class="ans">woolly mammoth</span>, <span class="para">the most famous of its kind</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          与此同时，一部分草原猛犸象变得越来越适应寒冷气候和开阔草原，<span style="color:var(--para-color);">孕育出了</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">长毛猛犸象</span>，<span style="color:var(--para-color);">这也是同类中最著名的一种</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>核心同义词替换</strong>：原文 <code>the most famous of its kind</code>（同类中最著名的）$\Longleftrightarrow$ 题干 <code>the well-known kind</code>（众所周知的种类）！</li>
          <li><strong>演变动词改写</strong>：原文 <code>giving rise to...</code>（孕育/产生出）改写为题干 <code>evolved to...</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="trap-box">
        <div class="trap-title"><span class="badge badge-warn">错题剖析</span> 你为什么会错写成 <span class="wrong-ans">steppe mammoths</span>？</div>
        <div class="trap-content">
          <strong>1. 混淆了“祖先物种”与“进化后代成果”</strong>：原文整句话的主语是 <code>some steppe mammoths were becoming... giving rise to the woolly mammoth</code>（是草原猛犸象孕育出了长毛猛犸象）。题干问的是<strong>被演变出来的那种著名的形态叫什么</strong>！<br>
          <strong>2. 漏看了同义替换核心修饰词</strong>：题干明确说了 <code>well-known kind</code>（著名的种类），这个修饰词完美对应了原文末尾的 <code>the most famous of its kind</code>，而紧贴着 <code>most famous</code> 的就是 <code>woolly mammoth</code>！<br>
          <strong>3. 逻辑去重检查</strong>：<code>steppe mammoth</code> 已经在 Q3 填过了，雅思 Summary 填空极少会在同一个段落内让同一个物种名字作为两个题目的答案。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q7: 错题 -->
    <div class="card" style="border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 7: 猛犸象最终灭绝的年代</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">4000</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>Eventually</code>、<code>went extinct around</code>、<code>years ago</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          <span class="loc">Eventually</span>, the mammoths <span class="para">went extinct around</span> 7 <span class="ans">[4000]</span> <span class="loc">years ago</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          <span style="color:var(--locator-color);">最终</span>，猛犸象在<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">大约</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">4000</span>】<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">年前</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">灭绝了</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P40 第2段末尾)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          The last stand of the mammoths appears to have taken place on Wrangel Island... and they survived for 5,000 years before <span class="para">dying out around</span> <span class="ans">4,000</span> <span class="loc">years ago</span>—around the time humans arrived.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          猛犸象的最后一站似乎发生在弗兰格尔岛……它们在那里存活了5000年，直到<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">大约</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">4000</span><span style="color:var(--locator-color);">年前</span>才<span style="color:var(--para-color);">彻底灭绝</span>——大约也就是人类抵达的时间。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>灭绝动词经典改写</strong>：原文 <code>dying out around ... years ago</code> 改写为题干 <code>went extinct around ... years ago</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>终结副词对标</strong>：题干开头的 <code>Eventually</code> 对标原文的 <code>The last stand of the mammoths</code>（猛犸象最后的栖息地/绝唱）。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="trap-box">
        <div class="trap-title"><span class="badge badge-warn">错题剖析</span> 你为什么会错写成 <span class="wrong-ans">100000</span>？</div>
        <div class="trap-content">
          <strong>1. 掉入“数字与生词近邻的视觉诱捕”</strong>：在 PDF P39 第二段，原文出现了：<br>
          <code>...expanded as the world entered the last ice age around 100,000 years ago and remained stable during that ice age. And then, as the ice age ended, it went extinct.</code><br>
          你眼睛扫到了 <code>100,000 years ago</code>，又在同一段扫到了 <code>went extinct</code>，大脑就仓促地把这两个词强行拼在了一起！<br>
          <strong>2. 致命逻辑颠倒</strong>：原文明确说 <strong>100,000年前是“种群数量扩张（expanded）并保持稳定”</strong>，是进入冰河期的起点，根本不是灭绝时间！<br>
          <strong>3. 没有读到全篇真正的最终终点（The last stand）</strong>：题干第一词是 <code>Eventually</code>（最终）。猛犸象真正最后的灭绝地点是在弗兰格尔岛（Wrangel Island），原文清清楚楚写着：<code>dying out around 4,000 years ago</code>。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= Section 2: Q8-Q12 ================= -->
    <h3 style="color:#60a5fa; margin-top:35px; margin-bottom:16px; font-size:16px; border-left:4px solid #3b82f6; padding-left:10px;">
      Part 2: The features of the woolly mammoths（长毛猛犸象的生理特征 · Q8-Q12）
    </h3>

    <!-- Q8 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 8: 猛犸象皮肤覆盖物</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">hair / coat</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>woolly mammoths</code>、<code>skin was covered with long</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Their skin was <span class="para">covered with long</span> 8 <span class="ans">[hair]</span>...
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          它们的皮肤<span style="color:var(--para-color);">覆盖着长长的</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">毛发（hair/coat）</span>】……
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P39 第1段第1-4行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          The woolly mammoth’s most distinctive feature was its <span class="para">long, shaggy</span> <span class="ans">coat</span>... Besides its <span class="para">long</span> <span class="ans">hair</span>, the woolly mammoth had a thick layer of fat...
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          长毛猛犸象最显著的特征就是它<span style="color:var(--para-color);">长而蓬乱的</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">皮毛（coat）</span>……除了其<span style="color:var(--para-color);">长长的</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">毛发（hair）</span>外，猛犸象还拥有一层厚厚的脂肪……
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>原词提取</strong>：形容词 <code>long</code> 后面直接修饰的被覆盖物是 <code>hair</code>（或 <code>coat</code>），均为单数原词。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q9 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 9: 抵御严寒的身体组织</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">fat</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>helped isolate from the cold</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          ...and their 9 <span class="ans">[fat]</span> <span class="para">helped isolate from the cold</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          ……并且它们的【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">脂肪（fat）</span>】<span style="color:var(--para-color);">有助于隔离严寒</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P39 第1段第4-5行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          ...the woolly mammoth had a thick layer of <span class="ans">fat</span> <span class="para">to insulate against the cold</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          ……长毛猛犸象拥有一层厚厚的<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">脂肪</span>，<span style="color:var(--para-color);">以隔绝严寒</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>考点动词近义改写</strong>：原文 <code>insulate against the cold</code>（隔绝寒冷）改写为题干 <code>isolate from the cold</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>名词提取</strong>：起隔热保温作用的核心名词就是 <code>fat</code>（脂肪）。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q10 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 10: 小耳短尾减少的消耗</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">heat</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>smaller ears and shorter tails</code>、<code>consumed less</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          The woolly mammoths had <span class="loc">smaller ears and shorter tails</span> which <span class="para">consumed less</span> 10 <span class="ans">[heat]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          长毛猛犸象拥有<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">较小的耳朵和较短的尾巴</span>，这可以<span style="color:var(--para-color);">消耗更少的</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">热量（heat）</span>】。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P39 第1段第5-7行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          It also had <span class="loc">smaller ears and a shorter tail</span> than its forebears, which would <span class="para">minimise heat loss</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          它还拥有比祖先<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">更小的耳朵和更短的尾巴</span>，这能<span style="color:var(--para-color);">最大限度减少热量散失</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>反向动作改写</strong>：原文 <code>minimise heat loss</code>（最小化热量流失）$\Longleftrightarrow$ 题干 <code>consumed less [heat]</code>（消耗更少的热量）；</li>
          <li><strong>核心不可数名词提取</strong>：答案提取 <code>heat</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q11 & Q12 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 11 & 12: 象牙的破坏与寻找功能</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">11. ice &nbsp;|&nbsp; 12. vegetation</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>ivories were rather huge</code>、<code>smash</code>、<code>discover</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P41)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Their <span class="loc">ivories were rather huge</span> and may have been used to <span class="para">smash</span> 11 <span class="ans">[ice]</span> and <span class="para">discover</span> 12 <span class="ans">[vegetation]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          它们的<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">象牙相当巨大</span>，可能曾被用来<span style="color:var(--para-color);">粉碎</span>【11. <span style="color:var(--ans-color);">冰块（ice）</span>】，并<span style="color:var(--para-color);">发现</span>【12. <span style="color:var(--ans-color);">植被（vegetation）</span>】。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P39 第1段末尾)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Its <span class="loc">huge tusks</span> may have been used like a snowplow to <span class="para">expose</span> <span class="ans">vegetation</span> to eat or to <span class="para">break up</span> <span class="ans">ice</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          它<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">巨大的长牙（tusks）</span>可能像扫雪机一样，被用来<span style="color:var(--para-color);">刨开</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">植被</span>来进食，或是<span style="color:var(--para-color);">击碎</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">冰块</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>象牙同义替换</strong>：原文 <code>tusks</code>（长牙/象牙）改写为题干 <code>ivories</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>动作动词互换</strong>：
            <ul>
              <li>原文 <code>break up [ice]</code> 改写为题干 <code>smash [ice]</code>；</li>
              <li>原文 <code>expose [vegetation]</code>（暴露/掀开植被）改写为题干 <code>discover [vegetation]</code>（发现植被）。</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= PASSAGE 2 ================= -->
  <section id="passage-2" class="passage-section">
    <div class="passage-title-bar">
      <h2>Reading Passage 2: Alfred Nobel（诺贝尔奖的缔造者）</h2>
      <div class="passage-meta">
        <span>📍 对应位置：PDF P31-P34 / 纸质 P14-P17</span>
        <span>🎯 题型：Summary 细节摘要填空（Q1-Q10）</span>
        <span>⚠️ 字数限制：NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS（不超过3个词）</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q1 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 1: 父亲伊曼纽尔的工程爆破技术</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">blasting rocks</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>Immanuel Nobel</code>、<code>techniques for</code>、<code>construction work</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P34)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          <span class="loc">Immanuel Nobel</span> was an engineer who <span class="para">developed various techniques for</span> 1 <span class="ans">[blasting rocks]</span> <span class="loc">for his construction work</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          <span style="color:var(--locator-color);">伊曼纽尔·诺贝尔</span>是一位工程师，他<span style="color:var(--para-color);">为自己的建筑工作开发了用于</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">爆破岩石</span>】<span style="color:var(--para-color);">的各种技术</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P31 Part 1 第2段)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          <span class="loc">In connection with his construction work</span> <span class="loc">Immanuel Nobel</span> also <span class="para">experimented with different techniques for</span> <span class="ans">blasting rocks</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          <span style="color:var(--locator-color);">结合他的建筑工作</span>，<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">伊曼纽尔·诺贝尔</span>还<span style="color:var(--para-color);">试验了用于</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">爆破岩石</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">的不同技术</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>同义形容词替换</strong>：原文 <code>different techniques</code> 改写为题干 <code>various techniques</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>原词提取</strong>：介词 <code>for</code> 后面原词照抄 <code>blasting rocks</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q2 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 2: 送阿尔弗雷德出国接受的专业培训</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">chemical engineering</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>sent his son, Alfred Nobel, abroad</code>、<code>receive training in</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P34)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          He <span class="loc">sent his son, Alfred Nobel, abroad</span> <span class="para">to receive training in</span> 2 <span class="ans">[chemical engineering]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          他<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">将儿子阿尔弗雷德·诺贝尔送到国外</span>，<span style="color:var(--para-color);">去接受</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">化学工程</span>】<span style="color:var(--para-color);">方面的培训</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P31 Part 1 第3段第1行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          In order to widen Alfred’s horizons his father <span class="loc">sent him abroad</span> <span class="para">for further training in</span> <span class="ans">chemical engineering</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          为了开拓阿尔弗雷德的视野，他的父亲<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">送他出国</span>，<span style="color:var(--para-color);">去接受</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">化学工程</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">方面的进一步培训</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>介词转动词不定式</strong>：原文 <code>for further training in</code> 改写为 <code>to receive training in</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>专业名词提取</strong>：介词 <code>in</code> 后直接带出学科名称 <code>chemical engineering</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q3: 错题 -->
    <div class="card" style="border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 3: 硝化甘油无法实用的根本原因</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">safety</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>In Paris</code>、<code>laboratory</code>、<code>inventor of nitroglycerine</code>、<code>unpractical</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P34)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          In Paris, Alfred Nobel worked in a private laboratory, and met the inventor of nitroglycerine, which was <span class="para">considered highly unpractical due to its</span> 3 <span class="ans">[safety]</span> <span class="para">risk</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          在巴黎，诺贝尔在一家私人实验室工作，遇到了硝化甘油的发明者；硝化甘油当时被<span style="color:var(--para-color);">认为极不实用，原因是由于它的</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">安全</span>】<span style="color:var(--para-color);">风险</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P31末跨至P32第1-4行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          ...invented nitroglycerine, a highly explosive liquid. But it was <span class="para">considered too dangerous to be of any practical use</span>... He also realised that the <span class="ans">safety</span> <span class="para">problems</span> had to be solved...
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          ……发明了硝化甘油这种高爆炸性液体。但它被<span style="color:var(--para-color);">认为太危险，以至于没有任何实用价值</span>……他也意识到必须解决<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">安全</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">问题</span>……
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>核心同义改写</strong>：原文 <code>too dangerous to be of any practical use</code> 改写为题干 <code>considered highly unpractical due to its ... risk</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>同义名词替换</strong>：原文 <code>safety problems</code> 被考官同义替换为题干 <code>safety risk</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="trap-box">
        <div class="trap-title"><span class="badge badge-warn">错题剖析</span> 你为什么会错写成 <span class="wrong-ans">highly explosive</span>？</div>
        <div class="trap-content">
          <strong>1. 掉入就近词眼陷阱</strong>：在原文第一行看到了 <code>a highly explosive liquid</code> 就直接搬了上去；<br>
          <strong>2. 语法搭配断裂</strong>：题干空格后自带名词 <code>risk</code>，填入 <code>highly explosive</code> 导致 <code>its highly explosive risk</code> 语法冗余扭曲；真正的名词定语是 <code>safety</code>（安全风险）。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q4 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 4: 诺贝尔想将硝化甘油应用到的领域</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">construction work</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>became interested in</code>、<code>apply this explosive liquid in</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P34)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Alfred Nobel <span class="loc">became interested in</span> <span class="para">how to apply this explosive liquid in</span> 4 <span class="ans">[construction work]</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          阿尔弗雷德·诺贝尔开始<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">对</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">如何将这种爆炸性液体应用到</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">建筑工程</span>】<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">中产生兴趣</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P32 Part 1 末尾)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Alfred Nobel <span class="loc">became very interested in</span> nitroglycerine and <span class="para">how it could be put to practical use in</span> <span class="ans">construction work</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          阿尔弗雷德·诺贝尔<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">对硝化甘油以及</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">如何将其投入实际应用到</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">建筑工程</span><span style="color:var(--locator-color);">中产生了极大的兴趣</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>动词短语替换</strong>：<code>put to practical use in</code> 改写为 <code>apply ... in</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>原词提取</strong>：介词 <code>in</code> 后提取 <code>construction work</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q5: 错题 -->
    <div class="card" style="border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 5: 斯德哥尔摩政府对危险实验的处理</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">forbidden</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>experiments</code>、<code>within the city area</code>、<code>government of the Stockholm city</code>、<code>move ... to a lake</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P34 Part 2)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Since the experiments were too dangerous and <span class="para">were</span> 5 <span class="ans">[forbidden]</span> <span class="loc">within the city area</span> <span class="para">by the government of the Stockholm city</span>, Nobel had to <span class="loc">move his experiments to a lake</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          由于实验太危险，并且<span style="color:var(--para-color);">被斯德哥尔摩市政府在</span><span style="color:var(--locator-color);">城市范围内</span>【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">禁止</span>】，诺贝尔不得不<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">把实验转移到了一个湖上</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P32 Part 2 第2段)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          ...convinced the authorities that nitroglycerine production was exceedingly dangerous. <span class="para">They forbade further experimentation</span> with nitroglycerine <span class="loc">within the Stockholm city limits</span> and Alfred Nobel had to <span class="loc">move his experimentation to a barge anchored on Lake Malaren</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          ……让当局确信硝化甘油的生产极其危险。<span style="color:var(--para-color);">他们禁止</span>在<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">斯德哥尔摩城市范围内</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">进行进一步的实验</span>，阿尔弗雷德·诺贝尔不得不<span style="color:var(--locator-color);">将其实验转移到停泊在梅拉伦湖上的一艘驳船上</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>主动变被动</strong>：原文 <code>They forbade experimentation</code> 改写为题干 <code>experiments were [forbidden] by the government</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>机经还原瑕疵</strong>：原文为过去式 <code>forbade</code>，考官在被动态题干中要求填过去分词 <code>forbidden</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="trap-box">
        <div class="trap-title"><span class="badge badge-warn">错题剖析</span> 你为什么会错写成 <span class="wrong-ans">nitroglycerine</span>？</div>
        <div class="trap-content">
          <strong>1. 忽视了被动语态语法结构</strong>：题干结构是 <code>were too dangerous and were 5 ______ by the government</code>，后面有 <code>by the government</code>，此处必须填过去分词或形容词！填入名词 <code>nitroglycerine</code> 语法完全不通。<br>
          <strong>2. 原文词眼顺风车</strong>：原文写 <code>experimentation with nitroglycerine</code>，眼睛顺着扫过去抓了名词，漏看了谓语动作 <code>forbade</code>（禁止）。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Q6 -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="q-title">Question 6: 与硝化甘油混合的新物质</div>
        <div class="q-ans-pill">kieselguhr</div>
      </div>
      <div class="locator-line">
        🎯 <strong>黄金定位词</strong>：<code>combined with nitroglycerine</code>、<code>convert liquid into a paste</code>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-stem"><span class="badge badge-q">1. 题干检索点</span> 考官题干句 (PDF P34 Part 2)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          Finally, he discovered 6 <span class="ans">[kieselguhr]</span> that could be <span class="para">combined with nitroglycerine</span> <span class="para">to convert liquid into a paste</span>.
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          最终，他发现了【<span style="color:var(--ans-color);">硅藻土（kieselguhr）</span>】，它可以<span style="color:var(--para-color);">与硝化甘油结合</span>，<span style="color:var(--para-color);">将液体转化为糊状物</span>。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-header header-orig"><span class="badge badge-orig">2. 原文事实点</span> 原文出处句 (PDF P32 Part 2 第4行)</div>
        <div class="en-text">
          He soon found that <span class="para">mixing nitroglycerine with</span> <span class="ans">kieselguhr</span> <span class="para">would turn the liquid into a paste</span>...
        </div>
        <div class="zh-text">
          他很快发现，<span style="color:var(--para-color);">将硝化甘油与</span><span style="color:var(--ans-color);">硅藻土</span><span style="color:var(--para-color);">混合，可以把液体变成糊状物</span>……
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logic-box">
        <div class="logic-title">⚡ 考官改写逻辑</div>
        <ul class="logic-list">
          <li><strong>动词同义替换</strong>：<code>mixing ... with</code> 改写为 <code>combined with</code>；<code>turn ... into</code> 改写为 <code>convert ... into</code>；</li>
          <li><strong>原词提取</strong>：混合介质原料生词 <code>kieselguhr</code>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

